/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weakening_Strike\" title=\"Weakening Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weakening Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Weakening_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weakening_Strike\" title=\"Weakening Strike\">Weakening Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Target an enemy's hands with a non-lethal attack and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weak_Grip_(Condition)\" title=\"Weak Grip (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weak Grip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Weak_Grip_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weak_Grip_(Condition)\" title=\"Weak Grip (Condition)\">Weak Grip</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special_weapon_actions\"> Special weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p>This weapon also grants the following:\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overheat\" title=\"Overheat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/40px-Overheat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/60px-Overheat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/80px-Overheat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overheat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/40px-Overheat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Overheat\" title=\"Overheat\">Overheat</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Release a fraction of your inner fire. All nearby creatures take damage and start <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Fiercely_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Fiercely (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Fiercely\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Fiercely_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Fiercely (Condition)\">Burning Fiercely</a>. </dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/25px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/38px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/50px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Azers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/25px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\">Azers</a></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although intended to be inaccessible to players, this weapon can be obtained by summoning an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/25px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/38px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/50px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Azer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/25px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\">Azer</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Azer\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/38px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/50px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Azer\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer\">Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer</a>, getting the Azer arrested, and then taking the confiscated weapon from the equipment chest in jail.</li></ul>\n\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195841\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.156 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.165 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6168/1000000\nPo